      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TEDESCHI (1) brings the clearest recent form after finishing second at Leonora last week, beaten just under two lengths behind Shimari when well found near the top of an open market. The back-up and return to 1000m are the small cautions, but he has already placed at around this trip and the 3kg claim strengthens his case. LEG GODT (5) was only fair when fifth at Moora, yet she was less than four lengths away and came through a race where the market expected her to run well. Can feature in the finish in a suitable race. INSPIRATIONAL MAC (2) was well beaten last week after being slow to begin, but the 2kg claim and second-up improvement give him some minor-money scope if he turns the corner. SAMBUCA ROSE (4) drops from Open grade and gets weight relief after a Landor third, though she comes from picnic company to a harder meeting and her good-track record keeps her more in the each-way bracket. LOVE OF FAR FA (3) is next.",
